# Public environment template for Vasan AI Studio Android app.
# Gemini AI features use Firebase AI Logic + App Check (no GEMINI_API_KEY needed).
# Video model API keys (Kling, MiniMax, Veo, Runway) live ONLY on the Node.js Express backend (/backend/.env).
# Optionally set a default public backend URL here or configure it in-app under Settings.
# VASAN_BACKEND_URL=https://your-vasan-backend.run.app
